      plannedOutputs: ["Weighted cumulative-incidence (risk) curves by strategy, with the difference in survival at the end of follow-up and in restricted mean survival time.", "Weight-distribution diagnostics (mean, range, extreme percentiles) and weighted covariate balance (SMD) between arms.", "Number of clones censored, and when, in each arm.", "Comparison of the CCW estimate with a conventional as-started analysis."],
    });

