        ["e. Outcomes",
          "Primary outcome: " + or(s.outcome, "(specify)") + ".",
          "Outcome: " + or(s.outcome, "(specify)") + "."],
        ["f. Causal contrasts",
          "Per-protocol effect — the effect of receiving and adhering to the assigned strategy.",
          "Primary estimand: the per-protocol effect via clone-censor-weight; " + effectText(s) + ". A conventional as-started (ITT-analogue) analysis is reported for comparison."],
        ["g. Identifying assumptions",
          "Exchangeability, positivity, and consistency; and — because artificial censoring is informative — no unmeasured predictors of deviation.",
