        "3": "Among " + or(s.population, "(population)") + ", what is the per-protocol effect of " + A + " vs " + B + " on " + or(s.outcome, "(outcome)") + "?",
        "4": "The two strategies cannot be distinguished at time zero and differ only over a grace period of " + grace + ", so a conventional as-treated analysis is biased by immortal time; the target trial is specified de novo and emulated by clone-censor-weight (Hernán 2016; Maringe 2020).",
